Mini E-Commerce Website
Project Description
This project is a responsive mini e-commerce website built using HTML, CSS, Bootstrap, and JavaScript. It allows users to browse products, add items to a shopping cart, manage product quantities, and complete a checkout process. The project focuses on front-end development and DOM manipulation.


⸻


Features
Product display using HTML and JavaScript
Add to cart functionality
Increase and decrease product quantity
Remove items from cart
Display total price calculation
Product search functionality
Category filter system
Dark mode toggle
Checkout form with validation
Responsive design for mobile, tablet, and desktop devices
LocalStorage support to save cart data


⸻


Technologies Used
HTML5
CSS3
Bootstrap 5
JavaScript (DOM manipulation, events, and logic)


⸻


How to Run the Project
Download or clone the project files
Open the project folder
Run the file index.html in any web browser
No additional installation is required


